WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:02.461
If you ain't got tatted by Cartoon,
you ain't got no tat.

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:05.005
If you ain't get shot by Estevan,
you got a weak photographer.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:06.215
Yo, kick it off, dog.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:10.219
Hip-hop culture owes so much
to Toons and Estevan.

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:11.136
Cartoon, baby.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.846
-My boy, Cartoon.
-Cartoon.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.556
Everything Cartoon did,

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.892
-Estevan was there.
-Capturing the whole culture.

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:20.395
-Lowrider culture. Tattoo culture.
-Everything, man.

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:24.900
I'm a photographer and director,
raised in LA.

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:26.276
Hip hop was new.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.320
I'm on tour with the Beastie Boys,
No Doubt,

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.447
The Fugees, Limp Bizkit...

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:32.783
And I'm the only one there with a camera.

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:36.578
I had to draw every day.

00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:41.667
At the time, in the '80s, it was all about
"Where do you fit in in hip hop?"

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.710
He was an awesome graffiti writer.

00:00:44.378 --> 00:00:47.589
I remember, like, his first
tattoos, it was like, "Oh, it's over."

00:00:47.673 --> 00:00:49.841
Cartoon gave Eminem
one of his first tattoos.

00:00:50.926 --> 00:00:53.887
I was documenting
Cartoon tattooing

00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:56.557
the biggest artists in the world
at that time.

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.642
It is a buddy comedy.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:01.853
And the more we hung out,
the more we just started building on ideas

00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:05.691
of things that we could do to make money
that weren't illegal.

00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:09.486
We looked at each other and we were like,
"We need to go to the next level, man."

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:10.904
And they grew that empire.

00:01:10.988 --> 00:01:12.573
Soul Assassin Studios.

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:13.699
Sh** just happened.

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:16.785
These dudes are like cholo da Vincis.

00:01:17.244 --> 00:01:19.121
They've been unstoppable
ever since.

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:21.707
They paved the way
for a lot of people.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:24.751
Now you have a new wave
of Chicano artists

00:01:24.835 --> 00:01:27.337
that can focus on Chicano pride.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.089
They are LA.

